{
  "goal": "Record the OPEN NEW SHARE capability against MERIDIAN CORE. (1) Sign on. (2) Member Inquiry -> search by Member Number for the memberId parameter -> Select. (3) Click 'Open New Share'. (4) For Share Type call choose with option = the shareType parameter value verbatim (the option's underlying value, e.g. MMKT); type the initialDeposit parameter into Initial Deposit; click Continue. (5) A review screen appears - the share is NOT yet opened. Click the committing button with irreversible=true (a human pre-authorised this recording). (6) On the confirmation screen use read to capture the new share identifier or confirmation number into an output named 'confirmationNumber' - target the value cell next to its label. (7) declare_done with capability_id 'member.openShare'.",
